-- Seven bundled questions split (new IT14-IT16, FA19, FA20, LB26, DG13, DM33); BO03 narrowed to tagging only.
update public.hub_chk_points set q='Is TDS deducted on payments to contractors and professionals where it applies?', why='Missed TDS means the expense is disallowed, plus interest.', law='Income-tax Act 2025 (TDS chapter)', evidence='TDS working per month', updated_at=now() where code='IT02';
update public.hub_chk_points set q='Are sales and purchases between the four Velite firms billed at a fair price?', why='Related-party dealings are the first thing examined in scrutiny.', law='Income-tax Act 2025; Companies Act s.188', evidence='Inter-firm ledger + basis note', updated_at=now() where code='IT07';
update public.hub_chk_points set q='Are drinking water and toilets provided and clean?', why='Basic welfare items every inspector looks at.', law='Factories Act s.18–19, 42–47', evidence='Photos / checklist', updated_at=now() where code='FA09';
update public.hub_chk_points set q='Are wages paid by the 7th of the month?', why='Late wages bring penalty and labour complaints.', law='Code on Wages 2019', evidence='Wage payment dates', updated_at=now() where code='LB04';
update public.hub_chk_points set q='Do export packs follow the export labelling rule?', why='Wrong labels are rejected at the foreign port.', law='Drugs Rules r.94', evidence='Export label file', updated_at=now() where code='DG05';
update public.hub_chk_points set q='Is every raw material tested and released by QC before use?', why='Untested material is the main cause of ''not of standard quality'' cases.', law='Schedule M; Schedule U', evidence='RM test reports + release labels', updated_at=now() where code='DM05';
update public.hub_chk_points set q='Are air receivers, autoclaves and other pressure vessels tagged with their last and next test dates?', why='Vessel failure causes serious injury.', law='Factories Act s.31', evidence='Photo of tags', updated_at=now() where code='BO03';
